      "body": "FutureSightDrive (FSDrive): 所提出的时空CoT使端到端的自动驾驶车辆能够以可视化地思考轨迹规划，并以极少的数据统一视觉生成与理解，从而首次推动自动驾驶朝着基于视觉推理方向发展。最近中稿人工智能顶级会议🎉🎉NeurIPS 2025 spotlight🎉🎉\n\nPaper：FutureSightDrive: Visualizing Trajectory Planning with Spatio-Temporal CoT for Autonomous Driving\nArxiv: https://arxiv.org/abs/2505.17685\nCode: https://github.com/MIV-XJTU/FSDrive\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a99a14a3-a892-4cbe-ac1f-66b777d9081b",
